{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1502825-how-do-you-run-world-war-ii-in-owod","id":1502825,"title":"How do you run World War II in oWoD?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-02-12T04:49:59-08:00","id":1502825,"title":"How do you run World War II in oWoD?","content":"Besides Wraith the Oblivion having material on WWII (<b>Charnel Houses of Europe: The Shoah</b>... *<i>shudders</i>*), how about the other gamelines? How do you run WWII in your chronicles?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-12T07:56:41-08:00","id":1502838,"title":"","content":"WW2 is kind of a sprawling topic. I've never used it as a setting very often. Usually it's more of historical stuff that continues to impact the modern setting (which is generally the focus of CHoE). But how if I do use the actual period, how I approach it depends heavily on which game I'm doing it with. <br /> <br /> Vampire is primarily a game about Personal Horror, in which one is often forced to make immoral or other back choices in order to avoid even worse ones. Most of my Vampire games default to a sort of Film Noir/Neo Noir style and mood anyway, and so with WW2 Vampire I just lean into that with a focus on a lot of the stuff away from the front lines and direct combat, especially in regards to issues of morality, the necessary actions to survive in places under the control of oppressive military occupation or political forces, and the idea that sometimes even morally compromised people can commit heroic acts (or at least attempt to). I tend to draw heavily on films like Casablanca (1942), The Damned (1969), Eye of the Needle (1981), Sophie's Choice (1982), Schindler's List (1993), Swing Kids (1993), Mother Night (1996), Valkyrie (2008) The Book Thief (2013), and Jojo Rabbit (2019). <br /> <br /> Werewolf is primarily a game about Savage Horror, in which ones dwells in a world of extreme violence and danger with only the occasional oasis of safety and succor. Most of my Werewolf games kind of drift between NeoNoir, Splatterpunk and Magical Realism. In WW2, this would be away from the front lines and the regular army in favor of Garou defending their territory from invading armies and the spiritual upheaval caused by the war and its atrocities. I tend to draw on things like Ilsa: SheWolf of the SS (1975), Band of Brothers (2001), Enemy at the Gates (2001), Defiance (2008), and Inglorious Basterds (2009). <br /> <br /> Mage, at least the way I approach it, is a game about Gnostic Horror, in which the safe and secure illusions of the world are pealed away to reveal sometimes uncomfortable or even terrifying truths. I tend to do a mix of NeoNoir, Magical Realism, and Pulp Adventure, with a focus on the espionage aspects of the war, especially in the worlds of period occult and odd weapons development. In this case, I draw on stuff like Raiders of the Lost Ark (1981), The Keep (1983), The Philadelphia Experiment (1984), Indiana Jones &amp; The Last Crusade (1989), The Rocketeer (1991), Hellboy (2004) and Pan's Labyrinth (2006)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-12T15:26:57-08:00","id":1502883,"title":"","content":"Well, first I make sure we have plenty of snacks.<br /> <br /> Jokes asides, I've never done WW2 as a setting. If I do, I'll probably take a cue from the Extra Credits video on alternate World War 2 locations/narratives, and from there it'd depend on my the game and my players.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-12T17:24:30-08:00","id":1502898,"title":"","content":"As an aside, two books I recommend for WW2 WoD:<ul><li>GURPS Weird War II (Steve Jackson Games), part of the fairly expansive GURPS WW2 subline they did, this gives a really good overview of period weirdness, including real world occult societies, the use of magic (stage craft and occult ritual) by both sides, various assassination plots, real world advanced and fringe science and possible scifi type technology, holy relics, monsters in the war (including the Universal Studios and German Expressionism types), &quot;realistic&quot; non-4 color superhumans, possible alternate history scenarios, and using things like Atlantis, the Hollow Earth or the Dreamlands as war fronts.</li> <li>The Nazi Occult (Osprey Publishing), written by Kenneth Hite, who was also the primary writer and developer of the above book, this is a fairly easy to read overview of both 3rd Reich fringe science and occult programs as well as the modern mythology of the Nazi occult legend. It sort of straddles the line between fiction and nonfiction, drawing very heavily on real world documentation and research in order to present it all as a single cohesive historical myth.</li> </ul>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-13T14:31:56-08:00","id":1502959,"title":"","content":"Haven't done anything with the time period yet, though I would like to at some point, as it does occasionally cross my mind. Recently I was wondering what night-to-night life was like for vampires in the Blitzkrieg. On the one hand, very easy to get your rival's haven bombed and the mortals are herding themselves into convenient locations for corralling. On the other hand, very easy for you to get bombed and vampiric resilience was not prepared for the invention of the bomb. The kine are on high alert for suspicious activity. If you have auspex, the air raid sirens are murder on delicate hearing. Depending on where you are, there may not be a city center in short order... I foresee a very irritable vampire population in the British Isles, with a large turnover rate in positions of power. And from a vampire perspective on the passage of time, the disruption of WW1 was basically <i>last week for fucks sake</i>. So VtM would probably focus on the impact of civilian life, stress and disruption to social order and the politics side of the war.<br /> <br /> Games of WtA and WtO are likely to focus on the war itself and the spiritual desolation caused by the various atrocities in progress.<br /> <br /> And maybe something for Changeling in the way of Pan's Labyrinth. The juxtaposition between hope and escapism and an extremely bleak, cruel reality.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><sup><i>Prone to hyperbole</i></sup>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26836-rhywbeth","name":"Rhywbeth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26836_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"377"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-15T03:08:08-08:00","id":1503124,"title":"","content":"I'm currently running a campaign set in pre-wwii Paris with the war only a few years away and the idea that this campaign will lead into a war campaign.<br /> <br /> I like the idea of a Werewolf game as it could be more action-packed but don't have much idea of a suitable 'enemy'. Would a bunch of actual Nazi Get of Fenris work?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11490-dogstar","name":"Dogstar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11490_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"381"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-15T11:49:49-08:00","id":1503150,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dogstar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1502825-how-do-you-run-world-war-ii-in-owod?p=1503124#post1503124\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm currently running a campaign set in pre-wwii Paris with the war only a few years away and the idea that this campaign will lead into a war campaign.<br /> <br /> I like the idea of a Werewolf game as it could be more action-packed but don't have much idea of a suitable 'enemy'. Would a bunch of actual Nazi Get of Fenris work?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Swords of Heimdall can work, but keep in mind that there aren't that many Garou around in the first place, let alone one camp of one tribe. So you'll need to use them for big juncture stuff in the story, and their involvement is going to be A Big Deal. Also, non-Swords Get are going to be hunting after them, and they are going to be very difficult to sway from this in the event that you have plans that aren't compatible with the Fenrir in question putting down their own, their way. Also, it's intensely shameful for them that the Swords exist in the first place.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-15T16:28:43-08:00","id":1503183,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>No One of Consequence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1502825-how-do-you-run-world-war-ii-in-owod?p=1502898#post1502898\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As an aside, two books I recommend for WW2 WoD:<ul><li>GURPS Weird War II (Steve Jackson Games), part of the fairly expansive GURPS WW2 subline they did, this gives a really good overview of period weirdness, including real world occult societies, the use of magic (stage craft and occult ritual) by both sides, various assassination plots, real world advanced and fringe science and possible scifi type technology, holy relics, monsters in the war (including the Universal Studios and German Expressionism types), &quot;realistic&quot; non-4 color superhumans, possible alternate history scenarios, and using things like Atlantis, the Hollow Earth or the Dreamlands as war fronts.</li> </ul></div> </div> </div> </div>That's possibly the best fountain of ideas for the topic. I've memory serves, Gurps has some 3-4 books on the subject at least, and it is superbly done. Using it is super easy to adapt for WoD, and possibly every single game hooks you could imagine are in there.<br /> <br /> For critters of WoD, flashing weird magic in the frontline may not be best - a Noir espionage game may be more fitting. But hey, action is one thing that will never be in short supply for a WW2 game","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24689-kakost","name":"Kakost","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"586"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-15T18:45:36-08:00","id":1503198,"title":"","content":"GURPS WW2 ended up having around ten books, I think. Besides the initial (and over-sized) WW2 book and Weird War 2, there was the Motor Pool book (vehicles) and full sized source books about the US forces (Dogfaces), Germany (Iron Cross), and the UK/Commonwealth (All the King's Men), and smaller booklets about Finland (Frozen Hell), France (Return to Honor), and Italy (Grim Legions). Also a booklet about special forces/commando units (Hand of Steel). The book about the Soviets (Red Tide) was apparently only released in pdf format. Over the years, there have also been pdf booklets about Poland (Doomed White Eagle) and Romania (Michael's Army), but oddly never anything about Japan or China.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-18T08:59:27-08:00","id":1503381,"title":"","content":"So, I just watched an incredible documentary about possibly the worse japanese war crimes during WW2 that was published today, telling in details about the infamous unit 731 and their inhuman experiments with infectious diseases and bioweapons, which included even such terrible acts as the vivesection of alive chinese TODDLERS and the spread of anthrax, typhoid and bulbonic plague on chinese civilian villages.<br /> <br /> In many many ways, the japanese were even worse than the Nazis themselves, and this is a fact that is very very rarely spoken or even acknowledged, and deserves to be better know to the public at large.<br /> <br /> And worse of all, one of the main reasons as to why the absolutely barbaric and monstruous actions of Japan are often sidelined and the focus of WW2 stories is almost entirely on Germany, is because the US actively covered it all up, due to petty concerns over the Cold War and the desire to get their hands on the japanese psychopathic experimentation with humans, which in the end proved absolutely useless since those &quot;experiments&quot; were little more than agonizing torture before execution of prisoners, much like the ones conducted by the Nazis, with barely any resemblance of a rigorous scientific methodology.<br /> <br /> Unlike the Nazis however, a COUNTLESS amount of japanese doctors who commited atrocious crimes such as inoculating chinese babies with anthrax or bulbonic plague or conducting living vivesections of chinese and russian (and others) civilian prisoners, ALL of them received immunity, and lived long lives, and many became &quot;renowned&quot; researches in Japan and even outside of it (some even went to american universities).<br /> <br /> And one of the greatest american &quot;heroes&quot;, General MacArthur, was one of the main responsible for this shameful cover up and that stain on history.<br /> <br /> This documentary talks about Unit 731, which for those that dont know it, was the Auschwitz of Asia.<br /> <br /> Watch this up, it is a very very important part of human history that cannot remain hidden or ignored.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/eMq-fApmzts\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/eMq-fApmzts\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/eMq-fApmzts\" target=\"_blank\"> https://youtu.be/eMq-fApmzts </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24689-kakost","name":"Kakost","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"586"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-20T16:27:04-08:00","id":1503572,"title":"","content":"So, some amazing WW2 stories: were they Mages? Shapeshifters? Something else? You decide!<br /> <br /> Introducing: the soldier who fought WW2 using a long sword and a bow (no, that's not a joke). Ladies and gentlemen, meet Mad Jack Churchill<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/3ZRVpYPFOl0\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/3ZRVpYPFOl0\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/3ZRVpYPFOl0\" target=\"_blank\"> https://youtu.be/3ZRVpYPFOl0 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> The Soldier of 3 Armies, Lauri T\u00f6rni, the scourge of the commies, the soldier who won medals for the finish, german and american armies, including the highest condecoration of the Finish army, the Mannerheim Cross, the German Iron Cross and the American Legion of Merit.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/Uz2Am9Ahy14\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/Uz2Am9Ahy14\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/Uz2Am9Ahy14\" target=\"_blank\"> https://youtu.be/Uz2Am9Ahy14 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> The One-Eyed Scout, Leo Major, the Quebecan soldier who liberated an entire dutch town BY HIMSELF<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/eFf1UfVa8Lc\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/eFf1UfVa8Lc\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/eFf1UfVa8Lc\" target=\"_blank\"> https://youtu.be/eFf1UfVa8Lc </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Simo H\u00e4yh\u00e4, the &quot;White Death&quot;, the best sniper of all times.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/JOBxKnM9J2s\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/JOBxKnM9J2s\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/JOBxKnM9J2s\" target=\"_blank\"> https://youtu.be/JOBxKnM9J2s </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24689,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24689-kakost","user":"Kakost","date":". 02-20-2023, 07:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24689-kakost","name":"Kakost","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"586"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-21T04:46:43-08:00","id":1503614,"title":"","content":"Currently on hiatus, but I have a Mage: the Ascension game set during WW2. Starting out in 1942, cause that's the year the Technocracy turned on the Nazis. Allowing us to have a mixed cabal of Traditionalists and Technocrats. (Following the example of Situation Six: <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Situation_Six\" target=\"_blank\">https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Situation_Six</a>) The characters are based in the UK. Their handler (Aleister Crowley) has sent them into occupied France to recruit a defector from the Vril Society, an all female Nazi aligned cabal.\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2198-malkavian87","name":"Malkavian87","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2198_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-21T17:19:31-08:00","id":1503652,"title":"","content":"Thanks to the inclusion of Crowley and the all-distaff willworker group, I can't help but imagine that as an otherworlds Raildex story.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-22T18:38:34-08:00","id":1503713,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shakanaka</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1502825-how-do-you-run-world-war-ii-in-owod#post1502825\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Besides Wraith the Oblivion having material on WWII (<b>Charnel Houses of Europe: The Shoah</b>... *<i>shudders</i>*), how about the other gamelines? How do you run WWII in your chronicles?</div> </div> </div> </div>So, I've actually ran WWII games, a few times. <br /> <br /> Background: a lot of my friends are wargammers and also like V:tM. A few friends were big on German-history and I've taken a college class on pre-war Germany, so, we had a good base. <br /> <br /> I ran a game based on The Great Patriotic-War, but, set in an alternate-universe,that I read online ('Twas the early days of the internet), were Germany pushed for Moscow, instead of Stalingrad, and a stale-mate developed on the Eastern Front, with the Western-Allies eventually taking Germany, but, the NAZI-government remained in Western-Russia. <br /> <br /> It was a mortals-game and all the players started out as mortals, doing military-actions and making a lot of humanity-rolls. We used vehicle combat-rules out of V:tPG.<br /> <br /> Game 2: I also ran a Wiemar-Republic Vampire game, in which all the players were mortals in the '20's and went through an embrace; the plan was to play through the '20's, '30's, '40's and beyond; basically, a vampire game with World War Two in the background and the build up and aftermath. Only played a few sessions. <br /> <br /> Vampires of the East game based in Java, '40's. I focused more on the day in the life of the Japanese occupation rather than the supernatural; I made a map of it and it was based round factory workers etc. Only ran one game. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-03T20:06:39-08:00","id":1504327,"title":"","content":"Look, I never got around to doing this, and I'm going to apologize if this somehow offends anyone, but I've already made a sketch of what a scenario would be like in World War II. Making it clear that it was based on some kind of avuse information.<br /> <br /> Basically WWII actually happened, but other things happened in parallel, one of which would be that the mages would have noticed the activation of a peculiar source of magic in Europe that was activated by the intense activity of the war, in fact this source nothing more it was from an antediluvian part that was preserved, then we joined two strands.<br /> <br /> As for the werewolves, in addition to the fact that some of the GoF joined the Nazis and others fought in the war to hunt them, in parallel there would be a plot of LoS, BF and BT having to face manifestations of fomori that appeared due to the conflict and even believing they were there solely to invade their territories. The Silent Striders would have a personal conflict, as many of their kinfolks were Jewish and I don't need to go into detail the problem this caused, so some of them interfered in the war.<br /> <br /> On the part of the Sabbat, they would see this as an opportunity to use the concentration camps and gulags as... butcher shops for lack of a better term and practically battle ghoul factories, of course they would notice the presence of the antediluvian and it would force a conflict against both wizards and werewolves.<br /> <br /> Other than that, within the war itself, the GW, BG, Fianna and CoG would be involved in the war to help their homeland or rescue refugees in the case of the CoG. Meanwhile, in the civilian environment, Camarilla vampires, rogue mages, changelings and kinfolks would do everything to escape the conflict and may even be hunted by hunters who believe that in the midst of this war, monsters will come out of their holes.<br /> <br /> As a bonus, I even thought of putting some demons from Demons: the Fallen involved in the middle, whether financing or fighting in the war depending on their faction. Yes, this is messy, and maybe a little offensive, but as you can see, this leaves many possible scenarios to include multiple adventures.\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-05T20:25:53-08:00","id":1504529,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1502825-how-do-you-run-world-war-ii-in-owod?p=1504327#post1504327\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Look, I never got around to doing this, and I'm going to apologize if this somehow offends anyone, but I've already made a sketch of what a scenario would be like in World War II. Making it clear that it was based on some kind of avuse information.<br /> <br /> Basically WWII actually happened, but other things happened in parallel, one of which would be that the mages would have noticed the activation of a peculiar source of magic in Europe that was activated by the intense activity of the war, in fact this source nothing more it was from an antediluvian part that was preserved, then we joined two strands.<br /> <br /> As for the werewolves, in addition to the fact that some of the GoF joined the Nazis and others fought in the war to hunt them, in parallel there would be a plot of LoS, BF and BT having to face manifestations of fomori that appeared due to the conflict and even believing they were there solely to invade their territories. The Silent Striders would have a personal conflict, as many of their kinfolks were Jewish and I don't need to go into detail the problem this caused, so some of them interfered in the war.<br /> <br /> On the part of the Sabbat, they would see this as an opportunity to use the concentration camps and gulags as... butcher shops for lack of a better term and practically battle ghoul factories, of course they would notice the presence of the antediluvian and it would force a conflict against both wizards and werewolves.<br /> . . .\u200b</div> </div> </div> </div>For Vampires, war, especially World War 2, would be a major inconvenience; you have increased mortal-patrols at night, shooting anything that moves. It's difficult to travel and to top it off, there are night-time firebombings in the city from bombers. There is a little bit more chaos, a vampire could exploit. But, for older-vampires, it's just another war. For Neonates, it's a big deal. Given the brutality of the Eastern Front, an Elder Russian vampire wouldn't even blink an eye at it after the wars of the centuries-past against, the Ottomans, the Prussians, the Golden-Horde, the Polish, etc. If the Waffen-SS met the ancient Mongols, they'd take notes. <br /> <br /> Wars tend to isolate the supernatural, and it's more localized than some greater agenda. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-07T15:38:12-08:00","id":1504784,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Iguazu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1502825-how-do-you-run-world-war-ii-in-owod?p=1504529#post1504529\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> For Vampires, war, especially World War 2, would be a major inconvenience; you have increased mortal-patrols at night, shooting anything that moves. It's difficult to travel and to top it off, there are night-time firebombings in the city from bombers. There is a little bit more chaos, a vampire could exploit. But, for older-vampires, it's just another war. For Neonates, it's a big deal. Given the brutality of the Eastern Front, an Elder Russian vampire wouldn't even blink an eye at it after the wars of the centuries-past against, the Ottomans, the Prussians, the Golden-Horde, the Polish, etc. If the Waffen-SS met the ancient Mongols, they'd take notes.<br /> <br /> Wars tend to isolate the supernatural, and it's more localized than some greater agenda.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Mages are an exception. Mages are the drivers and pushers of human culture. I reckon Mages to ALWAYS be very personally involved into the wars of the &quot;masses&quot;.<br /> <br /> Not fighting at the front thou, of course. The lords send the peasants to die - oh, sorry citizen, I meant that the bureaucrats send the &quot;masses&quot; to die, instead of themselves. <br /> <br /> Mages are too damn important for that, after all.<br /> <br /> For other night critters, they would mostly try to hide or run from those events, since those are nothing but trouble, with only some eventual gains.<br /> <br /> Also, most wars wouldnt directly and immediately end one of those critters, but a WW2 bomb being dropped at the wrong place at the wrong time could end even a few elders, a kind of risk that never before happened.<br /> <br /> I would assume that there have been more than a few nazis travelling to Argentina due to WW2, and that it's possible that there have been a bigger migration of monsters than just a bunch of war criminals<br /> <br /> PS: as a brazilian, it's always so delicious to have a chance to take a dump on argentinians lol","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24689-kakost","name":"Kakost","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"586"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-07T18:31:29-08:00","id":1504802,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kakost</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1502825-how-do-you-run-world-war-ii-in-owod?p=1504784#post1504784\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> . . .<br /> <br /> Also, most wars wouldnt directly and immediately end one of those critters, but a WW2 bomb being dropped at the wrong place at the wrong time could end even a few elders, a kind of risk that never before happened.</div> </div> </div> </div>No doubt, a good plot for a power-struggle in a city for a vampire-game.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I would assume that there have been more than a few nazis travelling to Argentina due to WW2, and that it's possible that there have been a bigger migration of monsters than just a bunch of war criminals </div> </div> </div>For the longest time, Argentina has had few people; a perfect place for monsters to go that don't like company; and they won't like these new monsters accompanying these war-criminals. Also, the NAZIs were only in power for like, 12 years really. I've been out of high-school longer. Unless they're a neonate or a young-Garou, the NAZIs were just a speed-bump in history.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> PS: as a brazilian, it's always so delicious to have a chance to take a dump on argentinians lol </div> </div> </div><i>Claro; los porte</i><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">\u00f1</span><i>os son boludos vivir son los cagen. </i> I used to live in Bs.As. It's a zoo. But, most Argentinians, people meet are from there, well, the three main tourist-barrios (Palermo, San Telma, Recoleta); they'll steal the shirt off of your back, if you let them. I don't know what's worse, I mean, the Fentanyl-junkies out here, might be worse than the Argentinians with stealing stuff. Once I got out of the city, the Argentinians were more manageable. If you only knew New-Yorkers as the only Americans you've met, you'd dislike Americans. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-08T05:40:41-08:00","id":1504836,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Iguazu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1502825-how-do-you-run-world-war-ii-in-owod?p=1504802#post1504802\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <i>Claro; los porte</i><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">\u00f1</span><i>os son boludos vivir son los cagen. </i> I used to live in Bs.As. It's a zoo. But, most Argentinians, people meet are from there, well, the three main tourist-barrios (Palermo, San Telma, Recoleta); they'll steal the shirt off of your back, if you let them. I don't know what's worse, I mean, the Fentanyl-junkies out here, might be worse than the Argentinians with stealing stuff. Once I got out of the city, the Argentinians were more manageable. If you only knew New-Yorkers as the only Americans you've met, you'd dislike Americans.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh dont get me wrong brother, dumping on Argentinians is a national hobby in Brazil.<br /> <br /> You're mistaken me. We dont hate Argentina or Aegentinians - quite the opposite. We are inseparable brothers, we feel like flesh and blood towards the &quot;boludos&quot; (a funny word for us, because in portuguese would mean to have &quot;big balls&quot; or something like it).<br /> <br /> We brazilians <b>love to hate Argentina.</b><br /> <br /> And the argentinians hate having to admit that they love Brazil.<br /> <br /> So, when we provoke one another, is like brothers provoking each other.<br /> <br /> In fact, we brazilians love those presumptuous arrogant bastards... And they hate to have to admit that they love us too hehe.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24689-kakost","name":"Kakost","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"586"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-08T19:11:14-08:00","id":1504892,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kakost</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1502825-how-do-you-run-world-war-ii-in-owod?p=1504836#post1504836\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Oh dont get me wrong brother, dumping on Argentinians is a national hobby in Brazil.</div> </div> </div> </div>No worries; it's cool. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> You're mistaken me. We dont hate Argentina or Aegentinians - quite the opposite. We are inseparable brothers, we feel like flesh and blood towards the &quot;boludos&quot; (a funny word for us, because in portuguese would mean to have &quot;big balls&quot; or something like it). </div> </div> </div>That's exactly what the word means. I've taught the Mexicans here that words and they've been calling people, &quot;Boludos&quot; and, &quot;Pelotudos&quot;.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> We brazilians <b>love to hate Argentina.</b><br /> <br /> And the argentinians hate having to admit that they love Brazil.<br /> <br /> So, when we provoke one another, is like brothers provoking each other.<br /> <br /> In fact, we brazilians love those presumptuous arrogant bastards... And they hate to have to admit that they love us too hehe.<br /> </div> </div> </div>People in large-cities tend to be ruder just because that's what's required in a city. I also met a lot of Brazilians down there because I spoke English. Most, were from the Southern-parts of Brazil and they always had a tolken-Asian in the group. Only problems I had with Argentinians was in Buenos Aires; one Porteno told me, &quot;Where there's people, there's problems; the countryside; no people, no problems&quot;!<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}